{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/terms/layout,_N_T_/terms/page,_N_T_/terms"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/terms/__PAGE__","/terms","/_index","/_head"]},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\" class=\"geist_a71539c9-module__T19VSG__variable geist_mono_8d43a2aa-module__8Li5zG__variable h-full antialiased\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/797e433ab948586e-s.p.0r6juujl39pe6.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/caa3a2e1cccd8315-s.p.0wgildi0cnwt9.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/3nnw541ftpatr.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/01dkdyukbdpqq.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/011mwum6do4jh.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3hdj40qmts5sf.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-3atuono2v9da2.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3_jx62oibvsso.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>Create Next App</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Generated by create next app\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.2vob68tjqpejf.ico\" sizes=\"256x256\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-full flex flex-col\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><nav class=\"border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur sticky top-0 z-50\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"font-extrabold text-white text-lg tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"text-amber-500\">🍛</span> FriscoBiryani</a><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:gap-4 text-xs font-semibold\"><a class=\"px-3 py-2 rounded-lg transition-colors text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/\">Menu &amp; Drop</a><a class=\"px-3 py-2 rounded-lg transition-colors text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/bid\">Vendor Bidding</a><a class=\"px-3 py-2 rounded-lg transition-colors text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/admin\">Admin Dashboard</a></div></div></nav><main class=\"min-h-screen bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 p-6 md:p-12\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-white\">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">Last updated: July 2026</p><div class=\"space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-white mt-6\">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2><p>By accessing FriscoBiryani.com, placing a reservation, or participating as a vendor, you agree to be bound by these Terms &amp; Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use this platform.</p><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-white mt-6\">2. Nature of Platform &amp; Role of Organizer</h2><p>FriscoBiryani.com operates strictly as an independent community coordination and reservation platform connecting local food enthusiasts with licensed commercial culinary partners. The platform organizer (Contact: team@svstech.com) acts solely as a digital host and does not directly prepare, manufacture, or store food items.</p><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-white mt-6\">3. Food Safety &amp; Health Waiver</h2><p>All food items supplied through weekend batches are prepared exclusively in certified commercial kitchen facilities adhering to Texas Department of State Health Services (DSHS) guidelines. However, participants acknowledge that food products may contain common allergens (including nuts, dairy, gluten, and spices). FriscoBiryani.com, its operators, and its technical teams disclaim all liability for allergic reactions, dietary sensitivities, or foodborne illnesses.</p><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-white mt-6\">4. Payments, Zelle &amp; Refunds</h2><p>All orders require peer-to-peer verification via Zelle. Reservations are non-refundable once the batch preparation window commences. The platform is not responsible for misdirected bank transfers.</p><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-white mt-6\">5. Limitation of Liability</h2><p>Under no circumstances shall the platform operators, developers, or affiliated entities at team@svstech.com be held liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the consumption of food items or use of this website.</p></div></div></main><footer class=\"border-t border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 text-slate-400 py-8 px-6 mt-16 text-xs\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4\"><div><p>© 2026 FriscoBiryani.com. All rights reserved.</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-slate-500\">Contact Organizer: <a href=\"mailto:team@svstech.com\" class=\"text-amber-400 hover:underline\">team@svstech.com</a></p></div><div class=\"flex gap-6\"><a class=\"hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/terms\">Terms &amp; Conditions</a><a class=\"hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/privacy\">Privacy Policy</a><a class=\"hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/health-disclaimer\">Health &amp; Food Safety Waiver</a></div></div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/01dkdyukbdpqq.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3t